e_item_assets/steam/apps/3540000/extras/84b72b0c72fad15bb9866532c699347d.poster.avif?t=1753363508\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540000/extras/84b72b0c72fad15bb9866532c699347d.webm?t=1753363508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540000/extras/84b72b0c72fad15bb9866532c699347d.mp4?t=1753363508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Message from the Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Getting Over It, Get to Work, and A Difficult Game About Climbing, and born from our own love of a good challenge, Kayaks Don\u2019t Climb is a testament to the rewarding nature of struggle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This game is designed to test your patience, your control, and your ability to laugh in the face of repeated failure. It's about the persistence it takes to overcome the seemingly insurmountable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>So grab your paddle, embrace the pain, and prepare to <strong>defy the impossible</strong>!</p>",
